{"id":"088d3f022fd3e30b","group":"18","path":"18/18-df-countable-proof-tree.md","title":"可数证明树（本地编号）","display":"df-countable-proof-tree — 可数证明树（本地编号）","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-df-countable-proof-tree","aliases":["18-df-countable-proof-tree","18-df-4.2-2"],"display":"df-countable-proof-tree — 可数证明树（本地编号）","depends_on":["[[18-df-proof-tree]]"],"verification_status":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-df-countable-proof-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-df-countable-proof-tree</span><span>18-df-4.2-2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-countable-proof-tree — 可数证明树（本地编号）"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"supplementary-definition-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)\">\\(\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)\\)</span> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"68c5bcff4a164cd8\" href=\"?note=68c5bcff4a164cd8\" title=\"18-df-proof-tree\">18-df-proof-tree</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span> 为上游谓词；本节引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\">\\(\\mathrm{CountableProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CountableProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\exists j:N\\to\\omega\\ \\forall m,n\\in N\\,(j(m)=j(n)\\to m=n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CountableProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\exists j:N\\to\\omega\\ \\forall m,n\\in N\\,(j(m)=j(n)\\to m=n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是既有本地支撑节点，文件名不是原书 Definition 4.2.2 的编号；后者实际定义语言的非逻辑符号。原书 Definition 4.4.2（印刷56，PDF66）给出由自然数有限序列表示的树，此类树自动可数。保留稳定文件名并撤销旧标题的伪精确来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-proof-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-proof-tree","status":"resolved","id":"68c5bcff4a164cd8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal P$、$\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)$ 按 [[18-df-proof-tree]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T=(N,\\prec,r,\\ell,c)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountableProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CountableProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ProofTree}_{\\mathcal P}(\\mathcal T)\\land\\exists j:N\\to\\omega\\ \\forall m,n\\in N\\,(j(m)=j(n)\\to m=n).","display":true}],"bytes":1130,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-27","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./18-df-countable-proof-tree]]"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-27","lo